lock=json.loads((ROOT/'configs/confirmatory_lock.json').read_text());lines+=['','## Frozen choices and causal controls','','The independent primary matrix fixes '+str(lock['primary_count'])+' shots per workload/configuration, before outcomes, under a five-hour sequential one-core cap. Component/baseline controls fix '+str(lock['secondary_count'])+' shared prefix IDs. Dedicated timing uses '+str(lock['timing_count'])+' independent IDs in '+str(lock['timing_repetitions'])+' fresh processes. The policy/data/source/binary lock is `configs/confirmatory_lock.json`. Its internal 10% validation rule is distinct from the external noninferiority hypothesis.','']
