lines+=['','The confirmatory controls include unchanged original; stronger repair-only solver; best BP; multi-candidate; adaptive; matched cut and joint; the SAME selected BP at original radius, radius2 and joint; and uniform stronger-inner-family joint, cut, and repaired variants. These prevent attributing an improved BP or inner-family substitution to the outer repair idea. Joint controls reuse the original global solution as their initial proposal instead of performing a deliberately redundant second identical solve; their prepared memory still includes conditional storage and is reported as implemented.','','Model-only pool construction and hashes are in `results/prepared_pools/manifest.json`. `results/selected_validation_diagnostics.jsonl` retains actual candidate classes, generated rank, cached-move logical rank, accessible faults, escalation and logical changes for 32 selected-policy validation IDs per workload. Matched-BP fixed-radius traces separately retain iterations, convergence/residuals and finite LLR quantiles; they are not misrepresented as the adaptive execution trace. Reverse-order redecoding matched exact corrections/frames on all 96 audited shots.','','Correctness evidence: 2,768 ASan/UBSan/leak native cases, six Python contract tests, BP reference differentials, small oracle brute-force checks, model/hash equivalence and shuffle/reset checks. Diagnostic builds are separate from uninstrumented production timing. Full logs, failures, deferrals and all unsuccessful policies remain in the evidence/results tree.']
